  "question": {
    "text": "A wire of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is bent to form a square <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> as shown in the figure. The effective resistance between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is:<br />( <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> is mid-point of arm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> )<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0272_6b3a96c5cf87.png\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>64</mn></mfrac><mi>R</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mi>R</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>R</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If the resistance of the wire is <em>R</em>, then each arm of the square has a resistance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. Accordingly. The resistance of segments DE and EC are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>DE</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>EC</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>We can draw the resultant circuit as follows:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0272_aff4eef5a61e.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 287px;\" /></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>56</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}